---
// "Did this help?" prompt (UX review). Hidden until Supabase is configured; site.js shows it.
---
<div class="card panel helpfb" id="helpFb" hidden>
  <div class="fbq"><b>Did this help you find a garage?</b>
    <button class="btn sm" type="button" data-help="yes">Yes</button>
    <button class="btn sm" type="button" data-help="no">Not really</button></div>
  <form class="fbmore" hidden><label class="fld" for="fbNote">What were you looking for?<input id="fbNote" maxlength="300" placeholder="One line is plenty" /></label><button class="btn sm primary" type="submit">Send</button></form>
  <p class="fbthanks okmsg" hidden>Thanks, that helps us improve.</p>
</div>
